(4) Theorem 5.12: with coverage U_t/Y_t -> 0 and a residual floor h(1-U/Y)+, survival <= prod(1 - h(1-eps)) after T_eps;
    whether Y grows is irrelevant to that bound (take Y constant and U_t decreasing: the bound holds). The premise (variety grows) is idle in the proof.
